        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4417_Flow14_di" bpmnElement="W4417_Flow14"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4417_Assoc10_di" bpmnElement="W4417_Assoc10"><di:waypoint x="340" y="460" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4418" name="W4418. Lease Modification, Reassessment &amp; Remeasurement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Lease change (scope/payment/term); judgment change
Frequency: Per modification (~tens–hundreds/yr)
Volume: Modifications across the ~205+ lease portfolio
Owner: Lease Accounting / Lease Admin (VS-42) / Controller
Participants: Lease Admin (VS-42), Legal (VS-100), Treasury (VS-18), Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20), Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4418 — Lease Modification, Reassessment &amp; Remeasurement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4418_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4418_Lane1" name="Lease Admin">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4418_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4418_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4418_Lane2" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4418_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4418_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4418_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4418_Start4" name="Lease change (scope/payment/term); judgment change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4418_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4418_Task5" name="Lease Admin/Legal identify &amp; classify the modification — *separate* lease…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Admin/Legal identify &amp; classify the modification — *separate* lease (additional ROU for added scope/rights) vs *modification/remasurement* of the existing lease (payment/term/Scope change)
Responsible (R): Lease Admin / Legal / Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4418_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4418_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4418_Task6" name="Lease Accounting remeasure the lease liability (revised payments at revised…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lease Accounting remeasure the lease liability (revised payments at revised discount rate) and adjust the ROU asset correspondingly (or P&amp;L for certain decreases), per PFRS 16
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4418_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4418_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4418_Task7" name="Lease Accounting post the remeasurement journal, update the abstract (W4411) &amp;…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting post the remeasurement journal, update the abstract (W4411) &amp; repository (W4426), and disclose material modifications (W4425)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4418_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4418_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4418_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4418_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4418_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-675 (ensure controlled execution — ROU Asset &amp; Lease Liability Measurement, Modification &amp; Reporting (PA-148.2).) | - CTL-675: modifications identified &amp; classified; liability remeasured at revised discount rate; ROU adjusted per PFRS 16; abstract/repository updated; reviewed (W4428)
Owner: Lease Accounting / Lease Admin (VS-42) / Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4418_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4418_Annotation9" targetRef="W4418_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4418_Flow11" sourceRef="W4418_Start4" targetRef="W4418_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4418_Flow12" sourceRef="W4418_Task5" targetRef="W4418_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4418_Flow13" sourceRef="W4418_Task6" targetRef="W4418_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4418_Flow14" sourceRef="W4418_Task7" targetRef="W4418_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4418_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4418_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4418">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4418_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4418_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4418_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4418_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4418_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4418_Start4_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Start4"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4418_End8_di" bpmnElement="W4418_End8"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="317" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4418_Annotation9_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Annotation9"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="460" width="360" height="100" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4418_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4418_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4418_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="790" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4418_Flow14_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Flow14"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4418_Assoc10_di" bpmnElement="W4418_Assoc10"><di:waypoint x="340" y="460" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4419" name="W4419. Lease Renewal, Termination &amp; Early-Exit Accounting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Renewal exercised; termination; early exit; store closure (VS-59)
Frequency: Per event (~10–15 store openings + closures/yr + renewals)
Volume: Renewals/terminations across the portfolio
Owner: Lease Accounting / Lease Admin (VS-42) / Real Estate (VS-97)
Participants: Lease Admin (VS-42), Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20), Store Ops (VS-07), Closure (VS-59), Legal (VS-100), Controller
Source: workflow W4419 — Lease Renewal, Termination &amp; Early-Exit Accounting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4419_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4419_Lane1" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4419_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4419_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4419_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4419_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4419_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4419_Start3" name="Renewal exercised; termination; early exit; store closure (VS-59)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4419_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4419_Task4" name="renewal">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Accounting/Lease Admin account for renewal — reassess term/options (W4412), remeasure liability/ROU (W4418) if reasonably-certain determination changes
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per renewal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4419_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4419_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4419_Task5" name="termination/early-exit">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lease Accounting/Real Estate account for termination/early-exit — derecognize ROU/liability (W4423), recognize termination penalty/early-exit payment, and handle MAKE-GOOD/restoration provision
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Real Estate / Legal
Accountable (A): Controller / COO
Duration: Per termination</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4419_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4419_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4419_Task6" name="Lease Accounting coordinate with store closure (VS-59), trigger fixed-asset/ROU…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting coordinate with store closure (VS-59), trigger fixed-asset/ROU disposal (VS-35/W4423), and update repository (W4426)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Store Ops / Controller
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per closure</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4419_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4419_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4419_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4419_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4419_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-111 (ensure PFRS 16 lease-accounting completeness.) | - CTL-675: renewals reassessed; terminations derecognized with penalty/MAKE-GOOD provisioned; disposal coordinated (VS-35/VS-59); reviewed
Owner: Lease Accounting / Lease Admin (VS-42) / Real Estate (VS-97)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4419_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4419_Annotation8" targetRef="W4419_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4419_Flow10" sourceRef="W4419_Start3" targetRef="W4419_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4419_Flow11" sourceRef="W4419_Task4" targetRef="W4419_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4419_Flow12" sourceRef="W4419_Task5" targetRef="W4419_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4419_Flow13" sourceRef="W4419_Task6" targetRef="W4419_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4419_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4419_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4419">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4419_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4419_Task4_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Task4"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4419_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4419_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4419_Start3_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Start3"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4419_End7_di" bpmnElement="W4419_End7"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4419_Annotation8_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Annotation8"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="290" width="360" height="72" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4419_Flow10_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Flow10"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4419_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4419_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="790" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4419_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W4419_Assoc9_di" bpmnElement="W4419_Assoc9"><di:waypoint x="340" y="290" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4420" name="W4420. Variable &amp; Index-Based Lease Payment Reassessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Index/CPI revision; turnover/usage variable; rent review
Frequency: Per index revision / rent review (often annual)
Volume: Leases with index-linked/escalation clauses (~170–190 of the ~205 leases; the majority carry CPI or fixed-step escalators)
Owner: Lease Accounting / Lease Admin (VS-42) / Treasury (VS-18)
Participants: Lease Admin (VS-42), Treasury (VS-18), Finance (VS-17.4), Audit (VS-21), Real Estate (VS-97)
Source: workflow W4420 — Variable &amp; Index-Based Lease Payment Reassessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4420_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4420_Lane1" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4420_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4420_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4420_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4420_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4420_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4420_Start3" name="Index/CPI revision; turnover/usage variable; rent review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4420_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4420_Task4" name="Lease Accounting/Lease Admin identify index-linked/escalation triggers (CPI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Accounting/Lease Admin identify index-linked/escalation triggers (CPI, fixed escalation ladder) and variable payments based on index/rate — remeasure when the future payment adjusts
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Lease Admin
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per trigger</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4420_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4420_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4420_Task5" name="Lease Accounting distinguish variable-based-on-index/rate (remeasure liability)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lease Accounting distinguish variable-based-on-index/rate (remeasure liability) from variable-based-on-performance/usage (expense as incurred, e.g. turnover rent) per PFRS 16
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Audit
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per lease</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4420_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4420_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4420_Task6" name="Lease Accounting post remeasurement (W4418), accrue variable performance/usage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting post remeasurement (W4418), accrue variable performance/usage payments to P&amp;L, and reconcile to AP (VS-15)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per period</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4420_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4420_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4420_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4420_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4420_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-675 (ensure controlled execution — ROU Asset &amp; Lease Liability Measurement, Modification &amp; Reporting (PA-148.2).) | - CTL-675: index-linked payments remeasured on revision; variable performance/usage expensed; distinction documented; reconciled to AP
Owner: Lease Accounting / Lease Admin (VS-42) / Treasury (VS-18)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
