    <bpmn:process id="W_W4421" name="W4421. Sublease &amp; Sale-and-Leaseback (Lessor-Side) Accounting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sublease executed; sale-and-leaseback (SLB) transaction
Frequency: Per transaction (~few/yr)
Volume: Subleases (e.g. BuildRight subletting surplus space) + occasional SLB
Owner: Lease Accounting / Controller / Real Estate (VS-97)
Participants: Real Estate (VS-97), Legal (VS-100), Finance (VS-17.4), Treasury (VS-18), Audit (VS-21), Tax (VS-79)
Source: workflow W4421 — Sublease &amp; Sale-and-Leaseback (Lessor-Side) Accounting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4421_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4421_Lane1" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4421_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4421_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4421_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4421_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4421_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4421_Start3" name="Sublease executed; sale-and-leaseback (SLB) transaction">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4421_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4421_Task4" name="intermediate lessor">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Accounting classify the sublease — BuildRight as intermediate lessor: retain lessee ROU/liability (scaled for right subleased) and recognize sublease income (finance or operating per IFRS 16 lessor model)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Real Estate
Accountable (A): Controller / COO
Duration: Per sublease</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4421_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4421_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4421_Task5" name="sale">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: For SLB, Lease Accounting/Legal determine if the transfer qualifies as a sale under PFRS 15 — if sale: seller-lessee recognizes only proportionate ROU, buyer-lessor recognizes the asset; if not-sale: accounted as a financing
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Legal / Finance
Accountable (A): Controller / CFO / VP Legal
Duration: Per SLB</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4421_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4421_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4421_Task6" name="Lease Accounting post lessor-side/sublease journals, disclose (W4425), and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting post lessor-side/sublease journals, disclose (W4425), and coordinate with Property Mgmt (VS-97) for the lessor operating model
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Real Estate
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4421_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4421_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4421_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4421_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4421_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-675 (ensure controlled execution — ROU Asset &amp; Lease Liability Measurement, Modification &amp; Reporting (PA-148.2).) | - CTL-675: sublease accounted as intermediate lessor; SLB sale-assessment per PFRS 15; lessor classification documented; disclosed &amp; reviewed
Owner: Lease Accounting / Controller / Real Estate (VS-97)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
