    <bpmn:process id="W_W4422" name="W4422. Short-Term &amp; Low-Value Lease Exemption Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New lease (W4413); policy threshold change
Frequency: Per lease + periodic review
Volume: Short-term &amp; low-value leases (small equipment, IT, short tenancies) across portfolio
Owner: Lease Accounting / Controller / Procurement (VS-34)
Participants: Procurement (VS-34), ITAM (VS-99), Lease Admin (VS-42), Finance (VS-17.4), Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4422 — Short-Term &amp; Low-Value Lease Exemption Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4422_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4422_Lane1" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4422_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4422_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4422_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4422_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4422_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4422_Start3" name="New lease (W4413); policy threshold change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4422_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4422_Task4" name="Lease Accounting/Procurement identify leases qualifying for short-term (≤12 mo…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Accounting/Procurement identify leases qualifying for short-term (≤12 mo, no purchase option) or low-value (below threshold, e.g. &lt;USD 5,000 standalone) exemption per policy (W4409)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Procurement / ITAM
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per lease</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4422_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4422_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4422_Task5" name="straight-line expense">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lease Accounting account for exempt leases on a straight-line expense basis (no ROU/liability), disclose the expense (W4425), and monitor for changes (extension beyond 12 mo) that remove the exemption
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per period</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4422_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4422_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4422_Task6" name="Lease Accounting/Audit periodically test the low-value threshold &amp; short-term…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting/Audit periodically test the low-value threshold &amp; short-term assessment, and reclassify if a lease no longer qualifies
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Audit
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4422_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4422_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4422_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4422_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4422_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-675 (ensure controlled execution — ROU Asset &amp; Lease Liability Measurement, Modification &amp; Reporting (PA-148.2).) | - CTL-675: exemptions applied per policy threshold; expensed straight-line; disclosed; monitored for extension; tested periodically (W4428)
Owner: Lease Accounting / Controller / Procurement (VS-34)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
