        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-675 (ensure controlled execution — ROU Asset &amp; Lease Liability Measurement, Modification &amp; Reporting (PA-148.2).) | - CTL-675: ROU impairment tested at indicators; derecognized at end/termination; MAKE-GOOD settled; disposed via FA register; disclosed &amp; reviewed
Owner: Lease Accounting / Controller / Fixed Assets (VS-35)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
