    <bpmn:process id="W_W4424" name="W4424. Intercompany Lease Elimination &amp; Consolidation Entries" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly consolidation; intercompany lease change
Frequency: Monthly per consolidation cycle
Volume: Intercompany leases across 5 entities (e.g. Property Mgmt → Depot)
Owner: Consolidation (VS-17) / Lease Accounting / Intercompany (VS-72)
Participants: Consolidation (VS-17), Intercompany (VS-72), Lease Accounting, Treasury (VS-18), Audit (VS-21), Controller
Source: workflow W4424 — Intercompany Lease Elimination &amp; Consolidation Entries</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4424_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4424_Lane1" name="Consolidation">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4424_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4424_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4424_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4424_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4424_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4424_Start3" name="Monthly consolidation; intercompany lease change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4424_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4424_Task4" name="Consolidation/Intercompany identify intercompany leases (lessor &amp; lessee within…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Consolidation/Intercompany identify intercompany leases (lessor &amp; lessee within the 5-entity group — primarily Property Mgmt as lessor), and match lessee-ROU/liability to lessor-asset/income
Responsible (R): Consolidation / Intercompany / Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4424_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4424_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4424_Task5" name="Consolidation post elimination entries — eliminate intercompany lease…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Consolidation post elimination entries — eliminate intercompany lease income/expense, eliminate intercompany ROU/lease-liability vs lessor-asset, eliminate unrealized profit, and eliminate intercompany receivable/payable
Responsible (R): Consolidation / Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4424_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4424_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4424_Task6" name="Consolidation validate the consolidated ROU/liability, reconcile to group FS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Consolidation validate the consolidated ROU/liability, reconcile to group FS (VS-17), and resolve any unmatched intercompany lease
Responsible (R): Consolidation / Audit
Accountable (A): Controller / CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4424_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4424_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4424_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4424_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4424_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-675 (ensure controlled execution — ROU Asset &amp; Lease Liability Measurement, Modification &amp; Reporting (PA-148.2).) | - CTL-675: intercompany leases identified &amp; matched; eliminations posted; consolidated ROU/liability validated; reconciled to group FS; reviewed (W4428)
Owner: Consolidation (VS-17) / Lease Accounting / Intercompany (VS-72)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4424_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4424_Annotation8" targetRef="W4424_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
